  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Irish Aid Funded Programme Grant II, Zimbabwe- COVID-19 Response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a continuation of ZIMB64. The project goal is to increase women and girls access to Sexual and Reproductive Health and Rights (SRHR) by 2021 through 1) Improving access to information and agency to make informed choices about their SRHR 2) Strengthen capacity of women&apos;s rights organisation to promote women&apos;s and girls health and rights 3) Improving access to integrated Sexual and Reproductive Health (SRH) Human Immunity Virus  -(HIV) services for women and girls  4) Hold duty bearers to account for development and implementation of laws and policies that promote women&apos;s health and rights</narrative>
  </description>
